00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:24.490
Oh, my God.

175
00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:25.050
I can't.

176
00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:26.850
We never had an F episode.

177
00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:27.270
Never.

178
00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:28.770
That I am certain of.

179
00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:29.930
We don't think so.

180
00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.610
But Miles is a tough grader.

