00:35:19.100 --> 00:35:22.300
Did she appear just as buildup for the next episode?

775
00:35:22.560 --> 00:35:23.300
What happened?

776
00:35:24.180 --> 00:35:26.080
Well, we both went to the shooting draft.

777
00:35:26.260 --> 00:35:27.300
There is a whole scene.

778
00:35:27.520 --> 00:35:29.400
It's actually in deleted scenes.

779
00:35:29.400 --> 00:35:30.440
And I thought we could hear it.

780
00:35:30.580 --> 00:35:31.620
It explains everything.

781
00:35:32.020 --> 00:35:32.860
