Meredith wants to know, how do you get a point?

937
00:43:33.450 --> 00:43:34.690
I loved that delivery.

938
00:43:35.490 --> 00:43:37.630
Phil Shea made that vibrator.

939
00:43:38.210 --> 00:43:38.650
What?

940
00:43:39.090 --> 00:43:39.610
Yeah.

941
00:43:40.030 --> 00:43:40.610
He made it.

942
00:43:40.610 --> 00:43:42.430
Is it like a back massager or something?

943
00:43:43.170 --> 00:43:43.990
I'm not sure.

944
00:43:44.210 --> 00:43:47.010
So I did get to talk to Steve Burgess about this episode.

945
00:43:47.210 --> 00:43:49.670
I had a lot of standards and practices questions.

946
00:43:50.130 --> 00:43:53.790
And like Randy Cordray, he saved all his emails.

947
00:43:53.790 --> 00:43:55.290
So he delivered.

948
00:43:55.690 --> 00:44:02.630
The big thing with this scene was that we could not show any logos for any real products.

949
00:44:02.630 --> 00:44:07.090
So everything that is on that table had to be created by Phil Shea.

950
00:44:07.330 --> 00:44:11.530
So Phil had to create the vibrator and the packaging.

951
00:44:12.710 --> 00:44:18.530
Standards and practices said, quote, we trust any visuals of the vibrator will be staged off

952
00:44:18.530 --> 00:44:18.990
camera.

953
00:44:19.450 --> 00:44:22.290
Well, standards and practices, I have news for you.

954
00:44:22.670 --> 00:44:24.390
It's very clearly on the table.

955
00:44:24.650 --> 00:44:25.770
It's on the far left.

956
00:44:26.270 --> 00:44:26.750
Yeah.

957
00:44:27.030 --> 00:44:29.830
No one is really excited about any of these prizes.

958
00:44:30.110 --> 00:44:32.770
So Andy is trying to get them more excited.

959
00:44:32.910 --> 00:44:33.970
What else can he offer them?

960
00:44:34.170 --> 00:44:35.830
How about for 500 points?

961
