I wear a dress to work.

962
00:44:37.190 --> 00:44:38.470
This gets a little chuckle.

963
00:44:38.810 --> 00:44:39.770
Andy is encouraged.

964
00:44:39.990 --> 00:44:41.750
He really leans into this now.

965
00:44:42.210 --> 00:44:43.450
Jim's going to egg him on.

966
00:44:43.590 --> 00:44:45.130
He's going to say, what about a thousand points?

967
00:44:45.430 --> 00:44:50.290
Andy said, I will run through the parking lot naked with a donut on my ding dong.

968
00:44:50.290 --> 00:44:51.410
Mm-hmm.

969
00:44:51.610 --> 00:44:53.570
Now everyone's really chuckling.

970
00:44:53.830 --> 00:44:55.710
And Andy's like, oh, yeah, you like that?

971
